# Citation metadata of the software, used by GitHub ("Cite this repository")
# and Zenodo (authors of each new archived version).
# Keep the same authors, in the same order, as Authors@R in DESCRIPTION.
# Each person also accepts `orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"`,
# `affiliation: "..."` and `email: "..."`.
